    "body": "All Web IDL methods are enumerable (e.g., `Headers.prototype.get`), which is different from ECMAScript (e.g., `Map.prototype.get`). What you see in iterators is just an extension of this difference. It’s too late to change enumerability for all objects, so the most we could do is make it consistent within Web IDL.",
